@model IEnumerable<DoChoiXeMay.Models.NV_GioCong>
<script src="~/Areas/Admin/Content/jquery2.0.3.min.js"></script>
<style>
    .tomau {
        background-color: darkkhaki;
    }
</style>
<div class="table-responsive">
    <table class="table">
        <thead>
            <tr style="background-color: #00bcd4">
                <th style="width:42px">@ViewBag.TongSoSoGioThang h</th>
                <th style="width:100px !important;text-align:center">Chek in/out</th>
                <th>VaoS</th>
                <th>RaS</th>
                <th>VaoC</th>
                <th>RaC</th>
                <th>V-TCa</th>
                <th>R-TCa</th>

                <th>V-Le</th>
                <th>R-Le</th>
                <th style="width:100px !important;text-align:center">NgayUpdate</th>
                <th style="width:100px !important;text-align:center"> hơn 4h: @ViewBag.SLcom</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        @if (Model != null)
        {
            var ht = DateTime.Now;
            var idnv= int.Parse(Session["idNhanVien"].ToString());
            var checkoutnum = new DoChoiXeMay.Areas.Admin.Data.LichTuanNV().numberAcbyLichTuan(idnv, ht.Year);
            var kq = 0;
            if (checkoutnum == 0)
            {
                kq = 25;
            }else if (checkoutnum == 1)
            {
                kq = 9;
            }else if(checkoutnum == 2)
            {
                kq = 13;
            }else if(checkoutnum == 3)
            {
                kq = 18;
            }
            foreach (DoChoiXeMay.Models.NV_GioCong item in ViewBag.NgayGioCong)
            {
                var Id = item.Id.ToString();
                var cl = "";
                if (item.GhiChu == "0")
                {
                    cl = "";
                }
                else
                {
                    cl = "tomau";
                }
                <tr class="@cl">
                    <td>
                        @Html.DisplayFor(modelItem => item.GhiChu)
                    </td>
                    <td>
                        @if (item.Day == ht.Day && item.Month == ht.Month && item.Year == ht.Year && ht.Hour>kq-1)
                        {
                            <a class="btn btn-primary" style="" onclick="return confirm('Bạn muốn Check in/out?')" href="/StaffTeK/DiemDanh/@item.Id"><i class="fa fa-pencil-square-o"></i>&nbsp;&nbsp;(@item.Day/@item.Month)</a>
                        }
                        else
                        {
                            <a class="btn btn-primary" style="" disabled><i class="fa fa-pencil-square-o"></i>&nbsp;&nbsp;(@item.Day/@item.Month)</a>
                        }
                    </td>
                    <td>
                        @item.GioVaoSang.ToString("HH:mm")
                    </td>
                    <td>
                        @item.GioRaSang.ToString("HH:mm")
                    </td>
                    <td>
                        @item.GioVaoChieu.ToString("HH:mm")
                    </td>
                    <td>
                        @item.GioRaChieu.ToString("HH:mm")
                    </td>

                    <td>
                        @item.GioVaoTangCa.ToString("HH:mm")
                    </td>
                    <td>
                        @item.GioRaTangCa.ToString("HH:mm")
                    </td>
                    <td>
                        @item.GioVaoLe.ToString("HH:mm")
                    </td>
                    <td>
                        @item.GioRaLe.ToString("HH:mm")
                    </td>
                    <td>
                        @Html.FormatValue(item.NgayUpdate, "{0:dd/MM/yyyy}")
                    </td>
                    <td>
                        @if (item.Day == ht.Day && item.Month == ht.Month && item.Year == ht.Year)
                        {
                            <a class="btn btn-warning" style="" href="/StaffTeK/UpdateGioCong/@item.Id"><i class="fa fa-pencil-square-o"></i>&nbsp;&nbsp;update h</a>
                        }
                        else
                        {
                            <a class="btn btn-warning" style="" disabled><i class="fa fa-pencil-square-o"></i>&nbsp;&nbsp;update h</a>
                        }
                    </td>
                </tr>
            }
        }


    </table>
</div>


